00:32:52,830 --> 00:32:54,070
Isn't that a genius?

877
00:32:54,640 --> 00:32:57,040
Can there really be
such a genius in Qingwu?

878
00:32:57,830 --> 00:32:58,420
Principal.

879
00:32:58,420 --> 00:32:59,950
Don't jump to conclusions.

880
00:33:00,350 --> 00:33:01,950
You haven't even met her yet.

881
00:33:03,720 --> 00:33:05,790
Actually, I don't even need to meet her.

882
00:33:05,790 --> 00:33:06,640
Her father and brother

883
00:33:06,640 --> 00:33:07,840
are both my students.

884
00:33:08,050 --> 00:33:08,880
You think I don't know

885
00:33:08,880 --> 00:33:10,480
what the two of them are like?

886
00:33:10,510 --> 00:33:11,260
Listen,

887
00:33:11,350 --> 00:33:13,830
there's no "phoenix"
coming out of this family.

888
00:33:13,830 --> 00:33:16,430
A "plain chicken" is the best
they can hope for.

889
00:33:17,640 --> 00:33:18,910
Yes, this is her house.

890
00:33:19,200 --> 00:33:19,860
Right here.

891
00:33:20,650 --> 00:33:21,200
Say that again!

892
00:33:21,200 --> 00:33:22,030
-Mom!
-Honey!

893
00:33:23,030 --> 00:33:23,830
Don't hit her!

894
00:33:24,720 --> 00:33:25,920
What is going on here?

895
00:33:27,210 --> 00:33:27,660
You...

896
00:33:28,110 --> 00:33:28,840
How could you

897
00:33:28,960 --> 00:33:29,880
hit your child?

898
00:33:32,150 --> 00:33:32,750
Qi Zhi,

899
00:33:33,110 --> 00:33:34,830
the principal went to your house.

900
00:33:34,830 --> 00:33:35,690
The principal?

901
00:33:36,030 --> 00:33:36,960
Went to my house?

902
00:33:38,030 --> 00:33:39,270
I just saw

903
00:33:39,550 --> 00:33:41,950
Cao Xin taking the principal
to your house.

904
00:33:42,590 --> 00:33:44,070
Don't get all the answers correct
on my homework.

905
00:33:44,070 --> 00:33:45,830
Otherwise, my teacher will
find it out at a glance.

906
00:33:45,830 --> 00:33:47,270
Make your writing a bit messy

907
00:33:47,270 --> 00:33:48,240
and cursive.

908
00:33:48,720 --> 00:33:49,240
Oh, no!

909
00:33:50,160 --> 00:33:50,960
What's wrong?

910
00:33:52,270 --> 00:33:53,310
What happened to her face?

911
00:33:53,310 --> 00:33:54,970
She looks like a little ghost.

912
00:33:55,360 --> 00:33:56,120
This child went to play

913
00:33:56,120 --> 00:33:58,070
in the coal pile early in the morning.

914
00:33:58,070 --> 00:33:58,960
Girl...

915
00:33:59,960 --> 00:34:00,620
Principal.

916
00:34:01,200 --> 00:34:02,730
You mean Cao Xin's homework

917
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:04,510
was done by our daughter?

918
00:34:04,680 --> 00:34:06,480
And she used some kind of equation?

919
00:34:06,480 --> 00:34:07,610
That's impossible.

920
00:34:08,239 --> 00:34:09,920
This girl hasn't been to school

921
00:34:09,920 --> 00:34:10,840
for a single day.

922
00:34:10,840 --> 00:34:12,590
She doesn't even know what an equation is.

923
00:34:12,590 --> 00:34:13,120
Exactly.

924
00:34:13,130 --> 00:34:14,949
I know what an equation is.

925
00:34:15,070 --> 00:34:16,360
I did this problem.

926
00:34:17,159 --> 00:34:18,070
In front of the teacher,

927
00:34:18,070 --> 00:34:19,590
don't... don't lie.

928
00:34:20,110 --> 00:34:20,820
Mrs. Huo,

929
00:34:20,850 --> 00:34:22,239
Qi Shi isn't lying.

930
00:34:22,960 --> 00:34:23,320
Yeah,

931
00:34:23,340 --> 00:34:24,500
I also think our daughter

932
00:34:24,500 --> 00:34:25,310
wouldn't lie.

933
00:34:25,440 --> 00:34:27,150
Well... Then, how about this?

934
00:34:27,440 --> 00:34:28,400
Let's put it

935
00:34:28,670 --> 00:34:29,670
to the test.

936
00:34:30,719 --> 00:34:31,840
I specially prepared

937
00:34:31,840 --> 00:34:32,840
a math test paper.

938
00:34:33,800 --> 00:34:34,630
Let's test

939
00:34:34,630 --> 00:34:35,710
Qi Shi's level.

940
00:34:37,070 --> 00:34:38,630
Does that mean I can go to school

941
00:34:38,630 --> 00:34:40,150
if I get them right?

942
00:34:43,030 --> 00:34:43,840
Qi Shi,

943
00:34:45,150 --> 00:34:47,179
if you can solve these problems,

944
00:34:47,360 --> 00:34:48,760
I'll do whatever it takes

945
00:34:49,710 --> 00:34:50,590
to get you

946
00:34:50,590 --> 00:34:51,850
to study at our school.

947
00:34:56,280 --> 00:34:56,760
Honey,

948
00:34:57,410 --> 00:34:58,440
look, the principal

949
00:34:58,440 --> 00:34:59,770
already came in person.

950
00:35:00,230 --> 00:35:02,150
If our girl really is talented,

951
00:35:02,320 --> 00:35:04,250
we shouldn't hold her back, right?

952
00:35:05,400 --> 00:35:06,150
Mrs. Huo,

953
00:35:06,630 --> 00:35:08,560
please just let Qi Shi give it a try.

954
00:35:15,190 --> 00:35:17,150
A great opportunity is
right in front of you.

955
00:35:17,150 --> 00:35:18,160
You must seize it,

956
00:35:18,320 --> 00:35:18,880
got it?

957
00:35:19,630 --> 00:35:20,160
Go ahead.

958
00:35:20,630 --> 00:35:21,760
-Come on.
-Come on.

959
00:35:22,670 --> 00:35:24,070
I'll go make some dishes.

960
00:35:24,800 --> 00:35:26,260
Aren't you very good at it?

961
00:35:26,800 --> 00:35:27,480
Show us.

962
00:35:28,360 --> 00:35:28,880
Qi Shi,

963
00:35:29,030 --> 00:35:30,760
read the questions carefully.

964
00:35:31,800 --> 00:35:32,530
You can do it!

965
00:35:36,710 --> 00:35:37,230
Okay.

966
00:35:37,800 --> 00:35:38,590
Well...

967
00:35:39,550 --> 00:35:41,030
Time starts now.

968
00:36:19,360 --> 00:36:20,110
Time's up.

969
00:36:28,510 --> 00:36:29,080
Mr. Wang.

970
00:36:29,440 --> 00:36:30,300
Check this out.

971
00:36:35,800 --> 00:36:36,840
Principal, Dad,

972
00:36:37,000 --> 00:36:37,640
it was me!

973
00:36:37,850 --> 00:36:38,880
Shouldn't you be at school?

974
00:36:38,880 --> 00:36:40,210
What are you doing here?

975
00:36:40,280 --> 00:36:41,540
It was you? What was it?

976
00:36:42,190 --> 00:36:42,850
It was me...

977
00:36:44,070 --> 00:36:45,730
I forgot to bring my workbook.

978
00:36:46,340 --> 00:36:47,070
Oh, boy.

979
00:36:47,100 --> 00:36:48,300
You're so forgetful.

980
00:36:48,440 --> 00:36:49,630
I don't know who you take after.

981
00:36:49,630 --> 00:36:50,690
He takes after you.

982
00:36:59,480 --> 00:37:00,810
What's the result, sir?

983
00:37:01,920 --> 00:37:03,380
Did she get them all wrong?

984
00:37:04,920 --> 00:37:05,580
Principal.

985
00:37:06,320 --> 00:37:08,280
This little girl has never been to school,

986
00:37:08,280 --> 00:37:10,320
so she doesn't have a solid foundation.

987
00:37:10,320 --> 00:37:11,060
Look here.

988
00:37:11,190 --> 00:37:12,920
There are a few basic mistakes.

989
00:37:15,110 --> 00:37:15,920
But this...

990
00:37:16,230 --> 00:37:17,090
This equation.

991
00:37:17,590 --> 00:37:19,190
She really knows how to solve it.

992
00:37:19,190 --> 00:37:20,590
This is incredibly rare!

993
00:37:21,550 --> 00:37:22,150
Let me see.

994
00:37:24,520 --> 00:37:26,030
There really is a "phoenix"

995
00:37:26,030 --> 00:37:27,230
coming out of Qingwu!

996
00:37:29,800 --> 00:37:30,460
Principal.

997
00:37:31,070 --> 00:37:31,920
Didn't you say

998
00:37:31,940 --> 00:37:33,760
if our Qishi really went to school,

999
00:37:33,760 --> 00:37:35,760
she might not keep up with the class?

1000
00:37:35,880 --> 00:37:37,000
She is

1001
00:37:37,030 --> 00:37:37,830
a rare talent.

1002
00:37:38,720 --> 00:37:39,840
The primary school in our town

1003
00:37:39,840 --> 00:37:41,000
just needs an excellent student

1004
00:37:41,000 --> 00:37:42,630
like her to set an example!

1005
00:37:44,000 --> 00:37:45,150
Great.

1006
00:37:45,880 --> 00:37:46,480
Qi Shi.

1007
00:37:47,030 --> 00:37:48,000
Let's not delay any longer.

1008
00:37:48,000 --> 00:37:49,710
You'll start school in a few days.

1009
00:37:49,710 --> 00:37:50,190
Okay!

1010
00:37:50,760 --> 00:37:51,280
Well,

1011
00:37:51,280 --> 00:37:52,150
y-you'll be in the same class

1012
00:37:52,150 --> 00:37:53,360
as Cao Xin.

1013
00:37:53,670 --> 00:37:54,960
You'll go straight to the second grade.

1014
00:37:54,960 --> 00:37:55,590
For real?

1015
00:37:55,670 --> 00:37:56,200
For real.

1016
00:37:56,960 --> 00:37:57,630
Great!

1017
00:37:58,630 --> 00:37:59,400
Great!

1018
00:38:01,360 --> 00:38:02,020
Principal.

1019
00:38:02,760 --> 00:38:04,560
There are so many people in the school.

1020
00:38:04,560 --> 00:38:05,440
The teachers in the class

1021
00:38:05,440 --> 00:38:07,040
can't take care of everyone.

1022
00:38:07,160 --> 00:38:09,120
If our girl really goes to school,

1023
00:38:09,150 --> 00:38:09,510
well,

1024
00:38:10,150 --> 00:38:11,440
we would still be worried,

1025
00:38:11,440 --> 00:38:11,840
right?

1026
00:38:12,920 --> 00:38:13,450
Mr. Wang.

1027
00:38:13,840 --> 00:38:14,230
Qi Shi

1028
00:38:14,230 --> 00:38:15,430
will be in your class.

1029
00:38:15,670 --> 00:38:16,960
She's such a bright kid.

1030
00:38:16,960 --> 00:38:17,930
Our school must

1031
00:38:17,960 --> 00:38:18,960
take special care of her

1032
00:38:18,960 --> 00:38:21,600
and make her a priority
for cultivation and protection.

1033
00:38:21,600 --> 00:38:22,320
Also, put her

1034
00:38:22,320 --> 00:38:23,190
in the front,

1035
00:38:23,510 --> 00:38:24,240
in the middle

1036
00:38:24,630 --> 00:38:25,630
of the first row,

1037
00:38:26,150 --> 00:38:26,510
okay?

1038
00:38:26,510 --> 00:38:27,190
Don't worry, Principal.

1039
00:38:27,190 --> 00:38:27,520
Okay.

1040
00:38:27,670 --> 00:38:28,800
I'll leave it to you.

1041
00:38:29,550 --> 00:38:30,440
Well,

1042
00:38:31,360 --> 00:38:32,000
see if you,

1043
00:38:32,590 --> 00:38:33,360
her parents,

1044
00:38:33,550 --> 00:38:34,480
have any other requests.

1045
00:38:34,480 --> 00:38:35,940
Feel free to bring them up.

1046
00:38:35,960 --> 00:38:37,820
If the teachers can't solve them,

1047
00:38:39,000 --> 00:38:39,930
leave them to me.

1048
00:38:41,710 --> 00:38:42,370
Principal.

1049
00:38:42,960 --> 00:38:43,760
Let's go back.

1050
00:38:44,190 --> 00:38:44,550
Okay.

1051
00:38:44,670 --> 00:38:45,330
Principal,

1052
00:38:45,550 --> 00:38:46,320
the food is ready.

1053
00:38:46,320 --> 00:38:47,420
Have a meal here before you go.

1054
00:38:47,420 --> 00:38:48,630
Yes, eat before you leave.

1055
00:38:48,630 --> 00:38:49,190
No, thanks.

1056
00:38:49,190 --> 00:38:50,710
We still have classes this afternoon.

1057
00:38:50,710 --> 00:38:51,840
Go on with your work.

1058
00:38:52,400 --> 00:38:53,280
Bye, Principal.

1059
00:38:53,280 --> 00:38:53,920
Principal,

1060
00:38:53,920 --> 00:38:54,440
take care.

1061
00:38:54,440 --> 00:38:54,840
Okay.

1062
00:38:54,920 --> 00:38:55,590
Principal, please

1063
00:38:55,590 --> 00:38:56,720
see yourselves out.

1064
00:38:57,920 --> 00:38:59,510
Qi Shi is going to school!

1065
00:39:04,440 --> 00:39:06,190
Qi Shi is going to school!

1066
00:39:07,320 --> 00:39:08,320
That's my sister.

1067
00:39:08,840 --> 00:39:09,240
Qi Zhi,

1068
00:39:09,440 --> 00:39:10,640
go pour the water out.

1069
00:39:13,800 --> 00:39:15,060
My precious daughter,

1070
00:39:15,630 --> 00:39:16,250
you really

1071
00:39:16,280 --> 00:39:17,480
made me proud today.

1072
00:39:18,110 --> 00:39:18,440
Dad,

1073
00:39:18,920 --> 00:39:20,310
you should praise me, too.

1074
00:39:20,310 --> 00:39:21,880
I taught my sister everything
about the schoolwork.

1075
00:39:21,880 --> 00:39:22,470
You?

1076
00:39:22,590 --> 00:39:24,320
You think I don't know you well?

1077
00:39:24,700 --> 00:39:26,230
You're at the bottom
of your class every year.

1078
00:39:26,230 --> 00:39:27,480
All you need to do is not lead

1079
00:39:27,480 --> 00:39:28,610
your sister astray.

1080
00:39:28,920 --> 00:39:29,400
Tell me.

1081
00:39:29,840 --> 00:39:31,440
Did you skip class again today?

1082
00:39:31,440 --> 00:39:32,880
And you said, "It was me."

1083
00:39:33,440 --> 00:39:34,630
Did your sister also

1084
00:39:34,630 --> 00:39:36,000
do your homework for you?

1085
00:39:36,000 --> 00:39:36,400
Dad,

1086
00:39:36,760 --> 00:39:37,840
I didn't say that.

1087
00:39:38,190 --> 00:39:39,450
You must've misheard!

1088
00:39:40,880 --> 00:39:42,810
Today is a good day for your sister.

1089
00:39:42,840 --> 00:39:44,570
I'll deal with you another day.

1090
00:39:45,670 --> 00:39:47,070
Why are we still cooking?

1091
00:39:47,710 --> 00:39:48,570
Let's go eat out

1092
00:39:48,760 --> 00:39:49,790
and celebrate.

1093
00:39:49,920 --> 00:39:51,480
Great, we're eating out!

1094
00:39:51,730 --> 00:39:53,130
Dad, I want lamb skewers!

1095
00:39:53,150 --> 00:39:54,320
Me, too.

1096
00:39:54,840 --> 00:39:55,170
Okay,

1097
00:39:55,480 --> 00:39:56,140
no problem.

1098
00:39:56,260 --> 00:39:57,030
My treat,

1099
00:39:57,480 --> 00:39:58,480
but your mom pays.

1100
00:40:02,000 --> 00:40:02,710
Cao Xin,

1101
00:40:03,440 --> 00:40:04,700
what do you want to eat?

1102
00:40:04,760 --> 00:40:05,880
I'll pass.

1103
00:40:06,000 --> 00:40:08,000
My grandpa had cooked for me at home.

1104
00:40:09,670 --> 00:40:10,230
Cao Xin,

1105
00:40:10,760 --> 00:40:11,690
you can't leave.

1106
00:40:13,550 --> 00:40:14,620
Eat with us.

1107
00:40:19,150 --> 00:40:19,630
Come on.

1108
00:40:20,440 --> 00:40:21,720
Okay, Mr. Qi,

1109
00:40:21,800 --> 00:40:23,200
I want lamb skewers, too.

1110
00:40:23,420 --> 00:40:23,820
Okay.

1111
00:40:24,570 --> 00:40:25,730
Why eat out?

1112
00:40:25,760 --> 00:40:27,000
The food is ready.

1113
00:40:27,020 --> 00:40:28,220
Why waste money?

1114
00:40:28,630 --> 00:40:29,030
Mom!

1115
00:40:29,050 --> 00:40:30,320
Mom, it's rare for us

1116
00:40:30,320 --> 00:40:31,150
to eat out.

1117
00:40:31,150 --> 00:40:31,840
Exactly!

1118
00:40:31,840 --> 00:40:33,000
Mr. Qi, Mrs. Huo,

1119
00:40:33,000 --> 00:40:33,880
my grandpa invited you

1120
00:40:33,880 --> 00:40:35,230
to have dinner at our place tonight.

1121
00:40:35,230 --> 00:40:36,840
Grandpa made braised mutton.

1122
00:40:36,840 --> 00:40:37,710
Hooray!

1123
00:40:37,800 --> 00:40:40,030
Awesome! Hooray!

1124
00:40:40,480 --> 00:40:41,280
-Good.
-Come on.

1125
00:40:41,280 --> 00:40:42,500
A little less for Qinglian,

1126
00:40:42,500 --> 00:40:43,480
and more for Aihua.

1127
00:40:43,480 --> 00:40:44,800
-Hello, Grandpa Cao, Mr. Cao.
-Hello, Grandpa Cao, Mr. Cao.

1128
00:40:44,800 --> 00:40:45,630
Hello.

1129
00:40:45,670 --> 00:40:46,550
We're coming.

1130
00:40:46,670 --> 00:40:47,760
You're here, Qinglian. Welcome!

1131
00:40:47,760 --> 00:40:49,280
I also brought a plate of dumplings.

1132
00:40:49,280 --> 00:40:50,400
Bring it to the kids.

1133
00:40:50,400 --> 00:40:50,920
Okay.

1134
00:40:51,410 --> 00:40:51,940
Dumplings!

1135
00:40:51,940 --> 00:40:52,590
Here.

1136
00:40:52,630 --> 00:40:53,230
Dongfang.

1137
00:40:53,360 --> 00:40:53,800
You know what?

1138
00:40:53,800 --> 00:40:54,630
-Thank you, Mom.
-You have no idea.

1139
00:40:54,630 --> 00:40:55,510
Thank you, Mrs. Huo.

1140
00:40:55,510 --> 00:40:56,510
This girl was

1141
00:40:56,550 --> 00:40:57,410
amazing today.

1142
00:40:57,760 --> 00:40:58,820
She hasn't studied

1143
00:40:59,000 --> 00:41:00,550
those equations for a single day!

1144
00:41:00,550 --> 00:41:01,920
But she solved them all!

1145
00:41:03,160 --> 00:41:04,360
At that time, the teacher

1146
00:41:04,360 --> 00:41:06,070
and the principal were both stunned.

1147
00:41:06,070 --> 00:41:06,530
He said,

1148
00:41:07,720 --> 00:41:08,400
"There's a 'phoenix'

1149
00:41:08,400 --> 00:41:09,730
coming out of our place.

1150
00:41:10,190 --> 00:41:11,150
Let her go to the second grade

1151
00:41:11,150 --> 00:41:12,210
just like Cao Xin."

1152
00:41:12,230 --> 00:41:13,360
Go straight to the second grade?

1153
00:41:13,360 --> 00:41:14,510
-Yes!
-Yes!

1154
00:41:15,110 --> 00:41:15,670
Sit down.

1155
00:41:16,400 --> 00:41:17,460
What did I tell you?

1156
00:41:17,960 --> 00:41:19,450
This girl is very smart!

1157
00:41:19,840 --> 00:41:20,490
Right?

1158
00:41:21,190 --> 00:41:21,760
-Come on.
-Come on.

1159
00:41:21,760 --> 00:41:22,220
Come on.

1160
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:23,600
Dongfang,

1161
00:41:24,030 --> 00:41:25,630
this is all thanks to Qinglian!

1162
00:41:25,630 --> 00:41:27,290
She deserves the most credit!

1163
00:41:27,320 --> 00:41:28,850
In the future, the children

1164
00:41:28,960 --> 00:41:30,890
should repay your kindness first.

1165
00:41:31,030 --> 00:41:31,760
-Yes!
-Come on!

1166
00:41:31,760 --> 00:41:32,800
Let's toast to Qinglian.

1167
00:41:32,800 --> 00:41:33,360
Toast... Toast to Qinglian.

1168
00:41:33,360 --> 00:41:34,630
What credit?

1169
00:41:34,650 --> 00:41:36,380
This is what a mother should do.

1170
00:41:36,480 --> 00:41:37,150
Cheers.

1171
00:41:37,480 --> 00:41:38,320
Did you know that?

1172
00:41:38,320 --> 00:41:40,580
My sister was specially enrolled today.

1173
00:41:40,590 --> 00:41:42,320
Who doesn't know? We already knew.

1174
00:41:42,320 --> 00:41:42,710
She's amazing.

1175
00:41:42,710 --> 00:41:43,300
I mean, this is

1176
00:41:43,300 --> 00:41:44,590
thanks to what I taught her.

1177
00:41:44,590 --> 00:41:46,650
That's thanks to Qi Shi's own talent.

1178
00:41:46,660 --> 00:41:47,540
Come on, eat up.

1179
00:41:47,590 --> 00:41:48,550
Let's eat up.

1180
00:41:48,840 --> 00:41:49,280
Try it.

1181
00:41:49,400 --> 00:41:50,510
I got it first.

1182
00:41:50,630 --> 00:41:51,630
I saw it first.

1183
00:41:52,400 --> 00:41:52,840
What is it?

1184
00:41:52,840 --> 00:41:53,480
-What's wrong?
-Qi Shi.

1185
00:41:53,480 --> 00:41:54,320
Don't fight over it.

1186
00:41:54,320 --> 00:41:55,030
One chicken drumstick.

1187
00:41:55,030 --> 00:41:55,670
Let him have it.

1188
00:41:55,670 --> 00:41:56,280
It's okay.

1189
00:41:56,480 --> 00:41:56,810
Here.

1190
00:41:57,290 --> 00:41:58,440
Aren't these chicken feet?

1191
00:41:58,440 --> 00:41:59,320
You each get a chicken foot.

1192
00:41:59,320 --> 00:42:00,230
Isn't that fine?

1193
00:42:00,230 --> 00:42:01,230
Those chicken feet have no meat.

1194
00:42:01,230 --> 00:42:01,800
Here, here.

1195
00:42:01,800 --> 00:42:02,770
Have some mutton.

1196
00:42:02,770 --> 00:42:03,230
Right, right.

1197
00:42:03,230 --> 00:42:04,430
Dongfang, Dongfang.

1198
00:42:05,080 --> 00:42:05,840
It's a stimulating food.

1199
00:42:05,840 --> 00:42:06,900
Qi Shi can't eat it.

1200
00:42:07,670 --> 00:42:08,590
Then don't eat it.

1201
00:42:08,590 --> 00:42:09,990
Mr. Cao, let me have some.

1202
00:42:10,670 --> 00:42:11,400
Get her some.

1203
00:42:12,670 --> 00:42:14,000
You know your own child

1204
00:42:14,000 --> 00:42:14,920
best.

1205
00:42:14,920 --> 00:42:15,360
Yes.

1206
00:42:15,510 --> 00:42:16,440
Others get involved

1207
00:42:16,440 --> 00:42:17,550
just for fun.

1208
00:42:19,670 --> 00:42:20,670
Qinglian is right.

1209
00:42:20,670 --> 00:42:22,440
Others get involved just for fun.

1210
00:42:22,440 --> 00:42:23,040
Let me try.

1211
00:42:24,480 --> 00:42:25,010
How is it?

1212
00:42:25,360 --> 00:42:25,890
How's it?

1213
00:42:26,300 --> 00:42:27,110
Good, it's so good.

1214
00:42:27,110 --> 00:42:27,670
Good, right?

1215
00:42:27,670 --> 00:42:28,000
Dad,

1216
00:42:28,360 --> 00:42:29,960
after I finish eating,

1217
00:42:29,980 --> 00:42:31,010
can I go out and play with Qi Shi

1218
00:42:31,010 --> 00:42:32,470
and the others for a while?

1219
00:42:32,550 --> 00:42:33,880
Have you done your homework?

1220
00:42:33,880 --> 00:42:35,670
I just have
a few characters left to write.

1221
00:42:35,670 --> 00:42:36,930
Then what do you think?

1222
00:42:37,110 --> 00:42:38,800
I see. I won't go.

1223
00:42:39,480 --> 00:42:40,110
Be good.

1224
00:42:41,080 --> 00:42:41,930
The kid is just

1225
00:42:41,960 --> 00:42:43,440
at a very playful age now.

1226
00:42:43,460 --> 00:42:45,050
Let him play if he wants to.

1227
00:42:45,080 --> 00:42:46,630
Having him do homework all day long,

1228
00:42:46,630 --> 00:42:47,230
aren't you afraid

1229
00:42:47,230 --> 00:42:48,630
it'll ruin his eyesight?

1230
00:42:48,960 --> 00:42:49,880
We must help him

1231
00:42:50,110 --> 00:42:51,510
develop good study habits

1232
00:42:51,510 --> 00:42:52,630
at this age.

1233
00:42:52,960 --> 00:42:53,420
He'll go

1234
00:42:53,810 --> 00:42:54,920
to a big city in the future.

1235
00:42:54,920 --> 00:42:55,500
He'll leave

1236
00:42:55,500 --> 00:42:56,580
our Qingwu Town.

1237
00:42:56,920 --> 00:42:58,380
Okay, fine, you're right.

1238
00:42:58,380 --> 00:42:59,640
Let's have it your way.

1239
00:43:00,030 --> 00:43:00,760
Here, honey,

1240
00:43:00,920 --> 00:43:01,720
